# Implementation Plan - Account Limits (سقف الحسابات)

The goal is to implement the "Account Limits" feature, ensuring proper domain, data, and presentation layer implementation, and linking it to the database.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will be implementing the missing Data Layer components (`AccountLimitModel`, `AccountLimitLocalDataSource`, `AccountLimitRepositoryImpl`) to support the existing Domain and Presentation layers.

## Proposed Changes

### Data Layer
#### [NEW] [account_limit_model.dart](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/models/account_limit_model.dart)
- Create `AccountLimitModel` extending [AccountLimitEntity](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/domain/entities/account_limit_entity.dart#3-126).
- Implement `fromJson`, [toJson](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/models/journal_entry_model.dart#74-88), `fromMap`, [toMap](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/models/opening_balance_model.dart#42-59) for database interaction.
- Map `account_limits` table columns to the model.

