### Presentation Layer
- [AccountLimitsCubit](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/presentation/cubit/account_limits_cubit.dart#8-43) and [AccountLimitsScreen](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/presentation/pages/accounts_limit_page_clean.dart#11-17) already exist. I will verify they work correctly with the new data layer implementation.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1.  **Add Limit**:
    - Go to Account Limits page.
    - Add a limit for an account (e.g., Debit Limit 1000).
    - Save.
    - Verify it appears in the list.
2.  **Check Limit Enforcement** (Future Step/Integration):
    - *This task focuses on CRUD of limits. Enforcement logic usually resides in Transaction creation (Journal Entry).*
    - I will ensure the [AccountLimitService](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/domain/services/account_limit_service.dart#5-65) has a method `checkLimit(AccountLimitViolation violation)` or similar to be used by other features.
3.  **Edit/Delete**:
    - Edit the limit.
    - Delete the limit.
